{"message":"I can help with mobile service issues, overdue bill payments, line suspensions, plan changes, data refueling, and roaming.

What are you trying to do today—technical support (calls/texts/data/MMS), pay an overdue bill, check a suspension, change plans, refuel data, or enable roaming?

If it’s technical support, please share the phone number on the line and what exactly isn’t working (calls, texts, mobile data, MMS), plus where you are (home area or traveling/abroad)."}

